kill/killall are forbidden, so pkill is used. -f matches against the full command line and sends the signal directly by name.

7. Highlander
bash#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Displays "To infinity and beyond" with sleep 2, and "I am invincible!!!" on SIGTERM
trap 'echo "I am invincible!!!"' SIGTERM

while true
